 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Wealth changed the business.",
    "zh": "财富管理改变了公司。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Net revenues grew from $26.2B (FY12) to $70.6B (FY25). Wealth and Investment Management are now 54% of revenue after E*TRADE and Eaton Vance, giving fee income that cushions trading cycles.",
    "zh": "净收入由 FY12 的 $262 亿增至 FY25 的 $706 亿。收购 E*TRADE 和 Eaton Vance 后，财富管理与投资管理占收入 54%，收费收入缓冲了交易周期。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Operating leverage is back.",
    "zh": "经营杠杆回来了。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The efficiency ratio fell from 77.2% (FY23) to 68.4% (FY25) and pre-tax margin rose to 31.1% (33.2% TTM). 9M 2026 Institutional Securities pre-tax income rose 39%.",
    "zh": "效率比由 FY23 的 77.2% 降至 FY25 的 68.4%，税前利润率升至 31.1%（TTM 33.2%）。2026年前 9 个月机构证券税前利润增长 39%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Returns are well above the cost of equity.",
    "zh": "回报明显高于股权成本。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "ROTCE reached 21.6% in FY25 and 22.6% in Q3 2026, against a 10.6% cost of equity. Tangible book per share rose from $39.18 (FY22) to $53.69 (Q3 2026).",
    "zh": "ROTCE 在 FY25 达到 21.6%，2026年Q3 为 22.6%，股权成本为 10.6%。每股有形账面由 FY22 的 $39.18 增至 2026年Q3 的 $53.69。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Capital is the payout limit.",
    "zh": "资本决定分配上限。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "CET1 is 14.9% against an 11.8% requirement (4.5% minimum + 4.3% stress buffer + 3.0% G-SIB). The quarterly dividend is $1.15 and a $20B buyback programme runs at ~$1.5-1.75B a quarter.",
    "zh": "CET1 为 14.9%，要求 11.8%（4.5% 最低 + 4.3% 压力缓冲 + 3.0% G-SIB）。季度股息 $1.15，$200 亿回购计划每季度约 $15-17.5 亿。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The market pays for the cycle top.",
    "zh": "市场按周期高点定价。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "At $185.57 the stock trades at 3.5x tangible book and 14.7x TTM EPS, up from 1.4x book at FY22. My model has net revenues growing only ~4.5% a year after a strong 2026.",
    "zh": "按 $185.57 计，股价为有形账面的 3.5 倍、TTM EPS 的 14.7 倍；FY22 年末仅为账面的 1.4 倍。我的模型在 2026 年强劲增长后，净收入每年仅增约 4.5%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "My value is below the price.",
    "zh": "我的估值低于股价。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $159.64 averages residual income ($151.14) and distributable capital ($168.13) at a 10.6% cost of equity (beta 1.22), with ROTCE near 26% by 2030. At $185.57 that is -14%; the Street ($211.50) is higher.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $159.64 是剩余收益（$151.14）与可分配资本（$168.13）的平均，股权成本 10.6%（beta 1.22），2030 年 ROTCE 约 26%。按 $185.57 计为 -14%；华尔街（$211.50）更高。"
   }
  }
